                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td height="5" colspan="2" valign="top"></td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td colspan="2" valign="top">
                                    <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="3">
                                        <tr>
                                            <td width="40">&nbsp;</td>
                                            <td width="135"><strong>a) Date</strong></td>
                                            <td width="10">:</td>
                                            <td><strong>@Html.DisplayFor(model => model.DOI, null, new { @class = "form-control" })</strong></td>
                                        </tr>
                                        <tr>
                                            <td width="20">&nbsp;</td>
                                            <td width="145"><strong>b) Reporting Time </strong></td>
                                            <td>:</td>
                                            <td><strong>07:30 AM</strong></td>
                                        </tr>
                                        <tr>
                                            <td>&nbsp;</td>
                                            <td valign="top"><strong>c) Venue</strong></td>
                                            <td valign="top">:</td>
                                            <td>
                                                Corporate office, Hindustan Copper Limited,
                                                Tamra Bhawan,
                                                1, Ashutosh Chowdhury Avenue, Kolkata - 700 019
                                                [Landmark: Opp. Ice Skating Rink, Ballygunge]
                                            </td>
                                        </tr>
                                    </table>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>
                        <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="3">
                            <tr>
                                <td width="25" valign="top">2.</td>
                                <td>Please  come prepared with the following documents and their specified no. of sets as  mentioned below. Please note that no photocopying support shall be available at  the venue of Personal Interview.</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td>&nbsp;</td>
                                <td>
                                    <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="4">
                                        <tr>
                                            <td width="15" valign="top">a.</td>
                                            <td>ORIGINAL Certificates / Testimonials of your Date of Birth, Qualification, GATE Score Card, GATE Admit Card, Experience (If any), Caste/ Category (for SC/ST/OBC/EWS candidates only), Disability (for PWD candidates only), Discharge (for Ex-Servicemen candidates only) as applicable. These shall be required for verification before commencement of Interview. In case of failure to present any or all of the said documents, you shall not be permitted to attend the Interview. If any of the required certificate is not in English or Hindi, please produce the self-attested translation of the same in English or Hindi.</td>
                                        </tr>
                                    </table>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>
                    </div>

                </div>

                <div class="footer">
                    <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
                        <tr>
                            <td><img src="@Url.Content("~/Content/img/footer.jpg")" width="100%" /></td>
                        </tr>
                    </table>
                </div>
                <div class="paging">Page <strong>1</strong> of <strong>4</strong></div>
            </div>
            <div style="page-break-after: always; padding-top: 10px"></div>
            <div class="BorderArea" style="border: solid 4px #6f3706">
