                                <td>
                                    <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="4">
                                        <tr>
                                            <td width="15" valign="top">a.</td>
                                            <td>
                                                The outstation candidates shall be entitled to reimbursement of travel expenses, to and fro journey, limited to Rail AC III Tier / ACC by the shortest route from the address of correspondence as declared in the online application to Kolkata, on submission of proof of journey (photocopy of Rail Ticket) failing which the claim for reimbursement shall not be entertained. Bus fare for road journey from / to a place not connected by Rail shall be admissible subject to production of proof of journey. Travel by higher class of train/ flight will  be restricted to Rail AC-3 tier fare.
                                            </td>
                                        </tr>
                                        <tr>
                                            <td width="15" valign="top">b.</td>
                                            <td>The  reimbursement towards to and fro journey shall be entertained only if the  candidate has actually been Interviewed. Please ensure that all documents  detailed in Para (2) above, in requisite number of sets as mentioned therein,  are submitted to ensure participation in the Interview.</td>
                                        </tr>
                                    </table>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td valign="top">4.</td>
                                <td>You  are advised to reach the Interview venue well in time.</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td valign="top">5.</td>
                                <td>You  are advised to come prepared to stay for one more day besides the day of Interview,  if required. You shall make your own arrangement for your stay in Kolkata.</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td width="25" valign="top">6.</td>
                                <td>In  case of variation / change in name / surname / spelling of name as mentioned in  the application with respect to that in the respective certificate(s)  pertaining to education / professional qualification / caste, etc., the  applicant shall be required to submit a certificate from SDM or equivalent to  this effect along with the respective documents at the time of Interview,  failing which the candidature shall be liable to be cancelled. </td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td valign="top">7.</td>
                                <td>Please  present a copy of this letter at the time of Interview</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td valign="top">8.</td>
                                <td>Please  acknowledge receipt of this letter and confirm your participation in the Interview  to the undersigned by email .</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td valign="top">9.</td>
                                <td>Please note that:</td>

                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td valign="top"><b>a.</b></td>
                                <td><b>Mere invitation to attend the interview shall not confer any legal right / claim for employment in Hindustan Copper Limited.</b></td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td valign="top"><b>b.</b></td>
                                <td><b>Your attention is drawn to clause 11 (vi) and clause 11 (vii) of the detailed employment advertisement of the company issued in this regard at the company’s website, details of which are reproduced hereunder for your ready reference.</b></td>
                            </tr>

                            <tr>
                                <td width="25">&nbsp;</td>
                                <td>
                                    <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="4">
                                        <tr>
                                            <td valign="top"><strong>i.</strong></td>
                                            <td><strong>Clause [11 (vi)]: Since all the applications will be screened based on the data furnished in the online application and without any documentary evidence / proof, the candidate should ensure that they meet all the prescribed eligibility criteria and other conditions as mentioned in this advertisement.</strong></td>
                                        </tr>
                                        <tr>
                                            <td valign="top"><strong>ii.</strong></td>
                                            <td><strong> Clause [11 (vii)]: Candidates should note that the details provided by them in their application forms are taken on their face value and the onus of proving the correctness and authenticity of the same as and when required lies with the applicant.</strong></td>
                                        </tr>
                                    </table>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>
