                            <tr>
                                <td valign="top" width="25">&nbsp;</td>
                                <td valign="top">
                                    <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="5">

                                        <tr>
                                            <td valign="top"><strong>c.</strong></td>
                                            <td colspan="2" valign="top">
                                                <strong>
                                                    You are therefore advised in your own interest to check, confirm and ensure that you meet the prescribed eligibility criteria for the post applied by you as detailed in the advertisement before presenting yourself for the Interview. You must also ensure that all requisite documents and copies thereof as detailed above are made available for submission and verification prior to the Interview. Please note that failure on either of these counts shall render you ineligible to attend the Interview and no communication in this regard shall be entertained by the Company.
                                                </strong>
                                            </td>
                                        </tr>
                                        <tr>
                                            <td valign="top"><strong>d.</strong></td>
                                            <td colspan="2" valign="top">
                                                <strong>
                                                    Your short-listing for the interview is based on the facts / statements made by you in your on-line application without any preliminary scrutiny of the same. If the detail is found to be materially wrong or incorrect or misleading, your candidature shall be liable to be cancelled at any stage of the recruitment process notwithstanding your attending the interview.
                                                </strong>
                                            </td>
                                        </tr>
